@startuml training-container-access
!include https://raw.githubusercontent.com/proveo-ca/identity/main/proveo.puml
' purpose: Bound the disposable, user-run HOST bind-access observation.
' covers: artifacts/training-functional/campaign-volume-preflight-1/container-access-1/**

title One-shot HOST container access preflight
actor "Executor" as EXEC <<host>>
participant "Offline HOST probe" as PROBE <<host>>
participant "Local Docker / retained image / runc" as DOCKER <<host>>
database "Private disposable bind directory" as BIND <<db>>

EXEC ARROW_MAIN PROBE : Run approved embedded source once\nChecked commit; 75s + 2s kill grace
PROBE ARROW_MAIN EXEC : Print exact name and path before writes
PROBE ARROW_MAIN BIND : Check volume identity and label
PROBE ARROW_MAIN DOCKER : Inspect local image digest for linux/amd64\nReject image-declared volumes
PROBE ARROW_MAIN BIND : Exclusively create directory and seed
PROBE ARROW_MAIN DOCKER : Create; no pull, networking or logging\nInspect confinement and bind before start
DOCKER ARROW_MAIN BIND : Verify pinned device and inode, then\nread seed and create/reopen reply
PROBE ARROW_MAIN DOCKER : Confirm exit and process label
PROBE ARROW_MAIN BIND : Verify reply and label checkpoints
opt Confirmed full container ID
  PROBE ARROW_MAIN DOCKER : Remove only that ID
end
opt Disposable directory created
  alt Directory pinned AND (no create requested OR removal confirmed)
    PROBE ARROW_MAIN BIND : Remove owned files via held descriptors\nRemove private directory and confirm absence
  else Directory not pinned or container removal uncertain
    PROBE ARROW_ERROR EXEC : Leave directory in place; do not retry
  end
end
alt Access observed and cleanup confirmed
  PROBE ARROW_MAIN EXEC : PASS for this bind and runc only
else Blocked or cleanup unconfirmed
  PROBE ARROW_ERROR EXEC : Report failure and cleanup separately
end

note over PROBE, DOCKER
  Client timeout does not cancel daemon work.
  Enforcement and labels are sampled.
  No relabel or campaign-root access.
  No preparation or training authority.
end note
@enduml
